cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "Computational assessment of oral contraceptive forgiveness: model and analysis pipeline"
abstract: >-
  An integrated population-pharmacokinetic and quantitative systems pharmacology
  model of the hypothalamic-pituitary-ovarian axis, used to quantify the
  missed-dose tolerance (forgiveness) of five oral contraceptive formulations
  across pack positions, CYP3A4 status and body weight.
